  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved decent employment opportunities through the development of employment programmes and policies in Tonga</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the positive results of the 2025 pilot programme on Quality Apprenticeships in Cookery, supported under the SDG South Pacific project, Tonga has been advancing the formulation of a National Apprenticeship Policy (NAP). This exercise will support the final validation and completion of the NAP, strengthening apprenticeship systems and contributing to the promotion of decent work in Tonga.</narrative>
  </description>
